BT /F2 13 Tf 44.0 504.0 Td (Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 482.0 Td (This backend uses LangGraph as the orchestration framework. A single Main HR Orchestrator creates an agent run,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 468.0 Td (invokes a compiled StateGraph, and returns a stable API response. The graph uses one LLM Router Agent plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 454.0 Td (deterministic fallback routing to send requests into specialized role paths.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 44.0 434.0 Td (Implemented shape) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 412.0 Td (- API entrypoint: routes/agentic_routes.py receives JSON or multipart requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 397.0 Td (- Main orchestrator: orchestration/main_orchestrator.py creates run_id and records running/completed/failed state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 382.0 Td (- LangGraph graph: orchestration/hr_graph.py builds StateGraph nodes and conditional edges.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 367.0 Td (- Router: agents/router_agent.py returns one route from screening, chat, jd, candidate, interview, dashboard,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 354.0 Td (reports, unsupported.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 339.0 Td (- Screening path: JD Agent -> Resume Agent -> Matching Agent -> Ranking Agent -> Summary Agent -> Final Response.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 324.0 Td (- Application paths: JD, candidate, interview, dashboard, reports use app_role_agent -> run_app_workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56.0 309.0 Td (- Chat path: recruiter_context -> recruiter_chat_agent -> Final Response.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 44.0 290.0 Td (Important concept) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 268.0 Td (LangGraph is used for stateful orchestration and routing. LangChain is present as a dependency, but the implemented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 254.0 Td (graph nodes call local Python agents, workflows, services, database helpers, and the existing OpenAI helper instead of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44.0 240.0 Td (LangChain runnable chains.) Tj ET
